  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "start",
      "type": "start-simple",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Training: Multiplizieren und Dividieren",
        "markdown": "Zehn Aufgaben zum Multiplizieren, Dividieren und Potenzieren von Produkten. Bei einem Fehler bekommst du einen Hinweis und einen zweiten Versuch.",
        "showOutline": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t1",
      "type": "task-math",
      "data": {
        "instruction": "Vereinfache.",
        "latex": "5x\\cdot 4y=\\placeholder[a]{}xy",
        "blanks": {
          "a": {
            "expected": "20",
            "accepted": []
          }
        },
        "compare": "symbolic",
        "partialCredit": false,
        "virtualKeyboard": true,
        "blankFeedback": [
          {
            "blank": "a",
            "latex": "9",
            "feedback": {
              "message": "Die Zahlen werden multipliziert, nicht addiert.",
              "severity": "warning"
            }
          }
        ],
        "evaluation": {
          "mode": "auto",
          "enableRetry": false,
          "showFeedback": true,
          "allowSkip": false
        }
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 140
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hilfe-t1",
      "type": "title-simple",
      "position": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 140
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Tipp",
        "markdown": "Sortiere die Faktoren: $5 \\cdot 4 \\cdot x \\cdot y$."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t2",
      "type": "task-math",
      "data": {
        "instruction": "Vereinfache.",
        "latex": "3\\cdot(4x)=\\placeholder[a]{}x",
        "blanks": {
          "a": {
            "expected": "12",
            "accepted": []
          }
        },
        "compare": "symbolic",
        "partialCredit": false,
        "virtualKeyboard": true,
        "blankFeedback": [
          {
            "blank": "a",
            "latex": "36",
            "feedback": {
              "message": "Nur ein Faktor wird mit 3 multipliziert: 3 · 4 = 12. Das x bleibt.",
              "severity": "warning"
            }
          }
        ],
        "evaluation": {
          "mode": "auto",
          "enableRetry": false,
          "showFeedback": true,
          "allowSkip": false
        }
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 280
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hilfe-t2",
      "type": "title-simple",
      "position": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 280
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Tipp",
        "markdown": "$3 \\cdot (4x) = 3 \\cdot 4 \\cdot x$. Es wird nur **ein** Faktor multipliziert."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t3",
      "type": "task-math",
      "data": {
        "instruction": "Vereinfache.",
        "latex": "(-6a)\\cdot(-\\frac{1}{2})=\\placeholder[a]{}a",
        "blanks": {
          "a": {
            "expected": "3",
            "accepted": []
          }
        },
        "compare": "symbolic",
        "partialCredit": false,
        "virtualKeyboard": true,
        "blankFeedback": [
          {
            "blank": "a",
            "latex": "-3",
            "feedback": {
              "message": "Minus mal Minus ergibt Plus.",
              "severity": "warning"
            }
          }
        ],
        "evaluation": {
          "mode": "auto",
          "enableRetry": false,
          "showFeedback": true,
          "allowSkip": false
        }
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 420
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hilfe-t3",
      "type": "title-simple",
      "position": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 420
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Tipp",
        "markdown": "Vorzeichen: $(-) \\cdot (-) = (+)$. Betrag: $6 \\cdot \\frac{1}{2} = 3$."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t4",
      "type": "task-math",
      "data": {
        "instruction": "Vereinfache.",
        "latex": "(-36xy):4=\\placeholder[a]{}xy",
        "blanks": {
          "a": {
            "expected": "-9",
            "accepted": []
          }
        },
        "compare": "symbolic",
        "partialCredit": false,
        "virtualKeyboard": true,
        "blankFeedback": [
          {
            "blank": "a",
            "latex": "9",
            "feedback": {
              "message": "Minus geteilt durch Plus ergibt Minus.",
              "severity": "warning"
            }
          }
        ],
        "evaluation": {
          "mode": "auto",
          "enableRetry": false,
          "showFeedback": true,
          "allowSkip": false
        }
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 560
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hilfe-t4",
      "type": "title-simple",
      "position": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 560
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Tipp",
        "markdown": "Nur den Zahlfaktor dividieren: $-36 : 4 = -9$."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t5",
      "type": "task-math",
      "data": {
        "instruction": "Vereinfache.",
        "latex": "5x:\\frac{1}{3}=\\placeholder[a]{}x",
        "blanks": {
          "a": {
            "expected": "15",
            "accepted": []
          }
        },
        "compare": "symbolic",
        "partialCredit": false,
        "virtualKeyboard": true,
        "blankFeedback": [
          {
            "blank": "a",
            "latex": "\\frac{5}{3}",
            "feedback": {
              "message": "Durch einen Bruch dividieren heißt: mit dem Kehrwert multiplizieren.",
              "severity": "warning"
            }
          }
        ],
        "evaluation": {
          "mode": "auto",
          "enableRetry": false,
          "showFeedback": true,
          "allowSkip": false
        }
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 700
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hilfe-t5",
      "type": "title-simple",
      "position": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 700
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Tipp",
        "markdown": "Durch $\\frac{1}{3}$ dividieren heißt mit $3$ multiplizieren."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t6",
      "type": "task-yes-no",
      "data": {
        "question": "Stimmt das? $(2x)^2 = 2x^2$",
        "correctAnswer": false,
        "evaluation": {
          "mode": "auto",
          "enableRetry": false,
          "showFeedback": true,
          "allowSkip": false
        }
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 840
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hilfe-t6",
      "type": "title-simple",
      "position": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 840
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Tipp",
        "markdown": "$(2x)^2 = 2x \\cdot 2x = 4x^2$. Beim Potenzieren wird **jeder** Faktor potenziert, auch die $2$."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t7",
      "type": "task-math",
      "data": {
        "instruction": "Vereinfache.",
        "latex": "(3a^2b)^3=\\placeholder[z]{}a^{\\placeholder[e]{}}b^{\\placeholder[f]{}}",
        "blanks": {
          "z": {
            "expected": "27",
            "accepted": []
          },
          "e": {
            "expected": "6",
            "accepted": []
          },
          "f": {
            "expected": "3",
            "accepted": []
          }
        },
        "compare": "symbolic",
        "partialCredit": false,
        "virtualKeyboard": true,
        "blankFeedback": [
          {
            "blank": "z",
            "latex": "9",
            "feedback": {
              "message": "3³ = 3 · 3 · 3 = 27.",
              "severity": "warning"
            }
          },
          {
            "blank": "z",
            "latex": "3",
            "feedback": {
              "message": "Auch die 3 wird potenziert.",
              "severity": "warning"
            }
          },
          {
            "blank": "e",
            "latex": "5",
            "feedback": {
              "message": "(a²)³ = a² · a² · a² = a⁶. Die Exponenten werden multipliziert.",
              "severity": "warning"
            }
          }
        ],
        "evaluation": {
          "mode": "auto",
          "enableRetry": false,
          "showFeedback": true,
          "allowSkip": false
        }
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 980
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hilfe-t7",
      "type": "title-simple",
      "position": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 980
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Tipp",
        "markdown": "$(3a^2b)^3 = 3^3 \\cdot (a^2)^3 \\cdot b^3$. Dabei ist $(a^2)^3 = a^2 \\cdot a^2 \\cdot a^2 = a^6$."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t8",
      "type": "task-choice",
      "data": {
        "instruction": "Welche Umformung ist richtig?",
        "variant": "single",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "o1",
            "markdown": "$6 \\cdot (2ab) = 12ab$",
            "correct": true
          },
          {
            "id": "o2",
            "markdown": "$6 \\cdot (2ab) = 12a \\cdot 12b$",
            "correct": false,
            "feedbackWhenChecked": {
              "message": "Nur ein Faktor wird mit 6 multipliziert.",
              "severity": "warning"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "o3",
            "markdown": "$x \\cdot x^3 = x^3$",
            "correct": false,
            "feedbackWhenChecked": {
              "message": "x · x³ = x · x · x · x = x⁴.",
              "severity": "warning"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "o4",
            "markdown": "$3 \\cdot (4x) = 12 \\cdot 3x$",
            "correct": false,
            "feedbackWhenChecked": {
              "message": "Die 3 wird nur einmal verwendet: 3 · 4x = 12x.",
              "severity": "warning"
            }
          }
        ],
        "shuffle": true,
        "partialCredit": false,
        "patternFeedback": [],
        "evaluation": {
          "mode": "auto",
          "enableRetry": false,
          "showFeedback": true,
          "allowSkip": false
        }
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1120
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hilfe-t8",
      "type": "title-simple",
      "position": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 1120
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Tipp",
        "markdown": "Beim Multiplizieren eines Produkts mit einer Zahl wird nur **ein** Faktor verändert."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t9",
      "type": "task-math",
      "data": {
        "instruction": "Vereinfache so weit wie möglich.",
        "latex": "6\\cdot 2a+a\\cdot 2+3\\cdot 5a=\\placeholder[a]{}a",
        "blanks": {
          "a": {
            "expected": "29",
            "accepted": []
          }
        },
        "compare": "symbolic",
        "partialCredit": false,
        "virtualKeyboard": true,
        "blankFeedback": [],
        "evaluation": {
          "mode": "auto",
          "enableRetry": false,
          "showFeedback": true,
          "allowSkip": false
        }
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1260
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hilfe-t9",
      "type": "title-simple",
      "position": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 1260
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Tipp",
        "markdown": "Zuerst jedes Produkt: $12a + 2a + 15a$. Dann zusammenfassen."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t10",
      "type": "task-math",
      "data": {
        "instruction": "Vereinfache so weit wie möglich.",
        "latex": "2x\\cdot 3x+4x\\cdot 5-x^2=\\placeholder[a]{}x^2+\\placeholder[b]{}x",
        "blanks": {
          "a": {
            "expected": "5",
            "accepted": []
          },
          "b": {
            "expected": "20",
            "accepted": []
          }
        },
        "compare": "symbolic",
        "partialCredit": false,
        "virtualKeyboard": true,
        "blankFeedback": [
          {
            "blank": "a",
            "latex": "6",
            "feedback": {
              "message": "Vergiss das −x² am Ende nicht: 6x² − x² = 5x².",
              "severity": "warning"
            }
          }
        ],
        "evaluation": {
          "mode": "auto",
          "enableRetry": false,
          "showFeedback": true,
          "allowSkip": false
        }
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1400
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hilfe-t10",
      "type": "title-simple",
      "position": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 1400
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Tipp",
        "markdown": "$2x \\cdot 3x = 6x^2$ und $4x \\cdot 5 = 20x$. Dann $6x^2 - x^2 = 5x^2$."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ende",
      "type": "end-tries",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1540
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Geschafft",
        "markdown": "Schau in der Übersicht nach, was schon gut klappt.",
